        <activityName xml:lang="en">Kitchen, front profile particle board, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Kitchen, front profile particle board, at plant
na;
UUID: 38b2d072-d25b-35e4-a1fb-eeee2f421fc6
This data set includes the basic structure of the kitchen cupboards (particle board with different coatings) and the front cover (particle board with different coatings). Screws and hinges are considered. The countertop is not included. Sink, cooker hood and waste system are included. The kitchen cupboards have an usable volume of 3.36 m3.  The area of front cover is 8.9 m2.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland
Location: Data valid for Switzerland
Technology: Average production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_38b2d072-d25b-35e4-a1fb-eeee2f421fc6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
